OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start this morning with
OL,6,Fperhaps the odd spot of light rain
OL,7,Fover the hills. Skies will brighten
OL,8,Ftowards lunchtime with sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping for the afternoon. Cooler
OL,10,Fthan of late, but still feeling warm
OL,11,Fin the sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny evening brightness will
OL,14,Fquickly be replaced by cloudy skies
OL,15,Fovernight. A few spots of rain then
OL,16,Fdeveloping by dawn, mainly over
OL,17,Fnorthern hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
