OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA rather cloudy start but some
OL,6,Fbreaks will develop allowing some
OL,7,Fsunshine. Feeling warm and humid with
OL,8,Fa few spots of rain possible, which
OL,9,Fmay turn heavier later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,12,Fspell of rain likely to move across
OL,13,Fthe region on Tuesday, with perhaps
OL,14,Fsome heavier bursts possible. Sunshine
OL,15,Fand showers on Wednesday and Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
